==Miscellaneous==
*Added 7 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**5,200 grants 5 Special Catseyes.
**5,250 grants 5 Rare Catseyes.
**5,300 grants 5 Super Rare Catseyes.
**5,350 grants 5 Uber Rare Catseyes.
**5,400 grants 3 Treasure Radars.
**5,750 increases [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]' level cap to +75.
**5,800 increases [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]' level cap to +80.
*[[Cat Combo]] can now be sorted by a cat unit's category.
*Number of Tickets will show as 99+ if the player has 100 or more tickets.
*[[Higher Score|Challenge Battle]] is re-added to the [[Cat Base Menu]].

==Trivia==
*This update added audio and sprites for the [[Barrier]] ability, which wouldn't be fully implemented until [[Version 6.5 Update|version 6.5]]. [[File:6.3 Barrier.png|thumb|Unused early Barrier spritesheet]] The pre-release Barriers had a different design, which most notably was blue instead of red; this may have been changed so that they would be easier to see against the already-blue skin of their [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] bearers.

